## API Exists But Is Not Bound To UI

| API Family | Product Impact |
|---|---|
| Org management | Tenants cannot be managed from the product |
| Module binding/share | Modules cannot be activated or shared from the product |
| Approval decisions | Human approval workflow cannot complete from UI |
| Module action request | Execution cannot be triggered from UI |
| Live gate writes | Operators cannot manage live rollout from UI |
| C15 DLQ/replay | Recovery cannot be operated from UI |
| Jobs/artifacts/reviews/errors create | Product records are mostly read-only |
| Registry writes | Modules/agents/workflows cannot be managed from UI |

